hadiths[158]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon se lade; unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya."
"4291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon se lade; beshak jab Allah azza wa jal ne un par charbi haram ki to unhon ne use pighlaya phir use becha aur us ki qeemat khayi."
"4292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us qaum se lade jo un cheezon ki tasveer banate hain jinhein wo paida nahi karte."
"4293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne maal ke liye lado yahan tak ke apna maal hasil karo ya qatl ho jao aur aakhirat ke shaheedon mein se ho jao."
"4294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ka qatil aur us ka maal chheenne wala aag mein hain."
"4295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un se lado yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; phir jab wo aisa karein to unhon ne tum se apne khoon aur maal bacha liye siwaye haq ke, aur un ka hisab Allah par hai."
"4296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo aur durust raho; kyunke Musalman ko jo museebat pahunche us mein kaffara hai yahan tak ke thokar jo use lage ya kaanta jo use chubhe."
"4297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo, durust raho aur khushkhabri hasil karo; aur jaan lo ke tum mein se koi apne amal se nijaat nahi payega, aur na main, siwaye is ke ke Allah mujhe apni rehmat aur fazl se dhaanp le."
"4298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do qazi aag mein hain aur aik qazi jannat mein: wo qazi jis ne haq jana aur us ke saath faisla kiya wo jannat mein hai; aur wo qazi jis ne haq jana phir jaan-boojh kar zulm kiya ya baghair ilm ke faisla kiya to wo donon aag mein hain."
"4299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beri kaatne wale ka sar Allah aag mein jhuka dega."
"4300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab main apne momin bandon mein se kisi bande ko aazmaun aur wo meri hamd kare aur jis se maine use aazmaya us par sabr kare to wo apne is bichhone se aise uthega jaise us din tha jab us ki maan ne use gunaahon se jana tha. Aur Rab azza wa jal muhafizon se farmayega: Maine apne is bande ko jakra aur aazmaya hai; pas use wo ajr likhte raho jo tum us ke liye us se pehle likhte thay jab wo tandrust tha."
"4301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab main apne momin bande ko aazmaun aur wo ayadat karne walon se meri shikayat na kare to main use apni qaid se chhor dunga, phir use us ke gosht se behtar gosht aur us ke khoon se behtar khoon badal dunga; phir wo naye sire se amal karega."
"4302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab main apne bande ko us ki pyaari cheezon se aazmaun, yani us ki aankhein, phir wo sabr kare to main un ke badle use jannat dunga."
"4303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab mera banda meri mulaqat se mohabbat kare to main us ki mulaqat se mohabbat karta hun, aur jab wo meri mulaqat ko na-pasand kare to main us ki mulaqat ko na-pasand karta hun."
"4304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab banda meri taraf baalisht qareeb ho to main us ki taraf haath qareeb hota hun, aur jab wo meri taraf haath qareeb ho to main us se baazu qareeb hota hun, aur jab wo mere paas chal kar aaye to main us ke paas daud kar aata hun."
"4305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab main apne bande se us ki qeemti cheezein le lun aur wo un par sabr kare aur bukhl kare to main un par us ke liye jannat se kam sawab par raazi nahi hunga jab wo un par meri hamd kare."
"4306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jab mera banda neki ka irada kare aur use na kare to main us ke liye aik neki likhta hun; phir agar wo use kare to main us ke liye das nekiyan se saat sau guna tak likhta hun. Aur jab wo burayi ka irada kare aur use na kare to main us par nahi likhta; phir agar wo use kare to main aik burayi likhta hun."
"4307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Maine apne naik bandon ke liye wo taiyar kiya hai jo na aankh ne dekha, na kaan ne suna aur na insaan ke dil mein khayal aaya."
"4308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai jis se banda aag se bachta hai; aur wo mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga."
"4309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Kibriya meri chadar hai; pas jo meri chadar mein mujh se jhagrega main use tor dunga."
"4310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Kibriya meri chadar hai aur izzat mera tehband hai; pas jo in mein se kisi mein mujh se jhagrega main use azaab dunga."
"4311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Kibriya meri chadar hai aur azmat mera tehband hai; pas jo in mein se aik mein mujh se jhagrega main use aag mein phenk dunga."
"4312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Mere jalal mein aapas mein mohabbat karne walon ke liye noor ke mimbar hain jin par Nabi aur shaheed rashk karenge."
"4313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Main shareekon mein shirk se sab se be-niyaz hun; jo aisa amal kare jis mein wo mere saath aur ko shareek kare to main use aur us ke shirk ko chhor dunga."
"4314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Maine rehem paida kiya aur us ke liye apne naam mein se naam nikala; pas jo use jorega main use jorunga, jo use torega main use torunga aur jo use kaatega main use katunga."
"4315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhe; agar bhalayi ka gumaan rakhe to us ke liye bhalayi hai aur agar burayi ka gumaan rakhe to us ke liye burayi hai."
"4316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhe; pas wo mujh se jo chahe gumaan rakhe."
"4317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal ne farmaya: Kharch kar, main tujh par kharch karunga."
"4318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Momin meri taraf se har bhalayi ke saamne hai; main us ki jaan us ke pehluon ke darmiyan se nikaalta hun aur wo meri hamd karta hai."
"4319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Tumhari ummat kehte rahenge ke ye kiya hai wo kiya hai yahan tak ke kahenge: Ye Allah hai jis ne makhlooq ko paida kiya, to Allah taala ko kis ne paida kiya."
"4320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Meri mohabbat aapas mein mohabbat karne walon par wajib ho gayi; main unhein qayamat ke din Arsh ke saaye mein saya dunga jis din mere saaye ke siwa koi saya nahi."
"4321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein mohabbat karne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi, meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein milne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi, meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein naseehat karne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi, meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein mulaqat karne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi aur meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein kharch karne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi. Mere liye aapas mein mohabbat karne wale noor ke mimbaron par honge jin ke muqaam par Nabi, siddiq aur shaheed rashk karenge."
"4322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Meri rehmat mere ghusse par sabqat le gayi."
"4323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne mujhe gaali di halanke use mujhe gaali nahi deni chahiye thi, aur mujhe jhutlaya halanke use mujhe jhutlana nahi chahiye tha. Raha mujhe us ka gaali dena to us ka kehna ke mera beta hai jabke main Allah Ahad Samad hun; maine na jana na mujhe jana gaya aur mere barabar koi nahi. Aur raha mujhe us ka jhutlana to us ka kehna ke wo mujhe aise nahi lautayega jaise us ne mujhe shuru kiya, halanke pehli paidaish us ke dobara par mere liye aasan nahi."
"4324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Mere bande, jab tum mujhe tanha yaad karo to main tumhein tanha yaad karta hun, aur agar tum mujhe majlis mein yaad karo to main tumhein un se behtar aur bari majlis mein yaad karta hun."
"4325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Mere bande, main tumhare gumaan ke paas hun jo tum mujh se rakho, aur main tumhare saath hun jab tum mujhe yaad karo."
"4326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Maine namaz ko apne aur apne bande ke darmiyan aadha aadha taqseem kiya hai, aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga. Phir jab banda kahe: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jo jahano ka Rab hai, to Allah farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri hamd ki. Phir jab wo kahe: Nihayat meherban rehem wala, to Allah farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri sana ki. Phir jab wo kahe: Badle ke din ka maalik, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri buzurgi bayan ki. Phir jab wo kahe: Ham teri hi ibadat karte hain aur tujh hi se madad mangte hain, to farmata hai: Ye mere aur mere bande ke darmiyan hai aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga. Phir jab wo kahe: Hamein seedhe raaste par chala; un logon ke raaste par jin par tune inaam kiya, un ke raaste par nahi jin par ghussa hua aur na gumrahon ke, to farmata hai: Ye mere bande ke liye hai aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga."
"4327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne mujhe jhutlaya halanke us ke liye ye na tha, aur mujhe gaali di halanke us ke liye ye na tha. Raha mujhe us ka jhutlana to us ka gumaan ke main use aise nahi lauta sakta jaise wo tha. Aur raha mujhe us ka gaali dena to us ka kehna ke mera beta hai; pas main paak hun is se ke biwi ya beta ikhtiyar karun."
"4328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ka har amal us ke liye hai siwaye roze ke, kyunke wo mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga. Aur roza dhaal hai; aur jab tum mein se kisi ka roze ka din ho to wo behuda baat na kare na shor kare; aur agar koi use gaali de ya us se lade to kahe: Main rozedar hun. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeeza hai. Aur rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain jin se wo khush hota hai: jab iftar kare to apne iftar se khush hota hai aur jab apne Rab se mile to apne roze se khush hota hai."
"4329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne rooh se farmaya: Nikal. Us ne kaha: Main na niklungi magar na-pasandeeda haal mein."
"4330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Jo jane ke main gunaahon ko bakhshne par qudrat rakhta hun main use bakhsh dunga aur parwa nahi karunga jab tak wo mere saath kisi ko shareek na kare."
"4331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Meri mohabbat mere liye aapas mein mohabbat karne walon, mere liye aapas mein baithne walon, mere liye aapas mein kharch karne walon aur mere liye aapas mein mulaqat karne walon ke liye wajib ho gayi."
"4332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam, main apne bande ke liye do aman aur do khauf jama nahi karunga; agar wo duniya mein mujh se aman mein rahe to main use us din darraunga jis din main apne bandon ko jama karunga, aur agar wo duniya mein mujh se dare to main use us din aman dunga jis din main apne bandon ko jama karunga."
"4333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Us se zyada zaalim kaun jo meri makhlooq jaisi makhlooq paida karne chala; pas wo daana paida karein, ya zarra paida karein ya jau ka daana paida karein."
"4334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Mannat Ibn Adam ko koi cheez nahi deti jo maine pehle se muqaddar na ki ho, lekin mannat use taqdeer ki taraf le jati hai jo maine us ke liye muqaddar ki hai; main us se bakheel se nikalwata hun aur wo mujhe us par wo deta hai jo wo mujhe pehle nahi deta tha."
"4335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Banda mujhe apne dil mein yaad nahi karta magar main use apne farishton ki majlis mein yaad karta hun, aur wo mujhe majlis mein yaad nahi karta magar main use aala saathiyon mein yaad karta hun."
"4336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Mere kisi bande ke liye munasib nahi ke kahe ke main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun."
"4337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, agar tum mujhe apne dil mein yaad karo to main tumhein apne paas yaad karta hun, aur agar tum mujhe majlis mein yaad karo to main tumhein un se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar tum mujh se baalisht qareeb ho to main tum se haath qareeb hota hun, aur agar tum mujh se haath qareeb ho to main tum se baazu qareeb hota hun, aur agar tum mere paas chal kar aao to main tumhare paas daud kar aata hun."
"4338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, jab tak tum mujhe pukaro aur mujh se ummeed rakho main tumhein bakhsh dunga jo kuch tum se hua aur parwa nahi karunga. Ae Ibn Adam, agar tumhare gunah aasman ke kinare tak pahunch jayen phir tum mujh se bakhshish mango to main tumhein bakhsh dunga aur parwa nahi karunga. Ae Ibn Adam, agar tum mere paas zameen bhar khataen lekar aao phir mujh se is haal mein milo ke mere saath kisi ko shareek na karte ho to main tumhare paas us bhar bakhshish lekar aaunga."
"4339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, mere liye din ke awwal mein chaar rakatein parh, main tumhein aakhir tak kafi hunga."
"4340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, meri taraf utho main tumhari taraf chalunga, aur meri taraf chalo main tumhari taraf daudunga."
"4341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, jab tak tum meri ibadat karo aur mujh se ummeed rakho aur mere saath kisi ko shareek na karo main tumhein bakhsh dunga jo kuch tum se hua; aur agar tum mera isteqbal aasman o zameen bhar khataon aur gunaahon se karo to main tumhara isteqbal un bhar bakhshish se karunga aur tumhein bakhsh dunga aur parwa nahi karunga."
"4342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam, din ke awwal mein chaar rakaaton se aajiz na ho, main tumhein aakhir tak kafi hunga."
"4343","[AI-translation] Allah taala ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mujhe takleef deta hai; wo zamane ko gaali deta hai halanke main zamana hun; muamla mere haath mein hai, main raat aur din ko pherta hun."
"4344","[AI-translation] Allah taala ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mujhe takleef deta hai; wo kehta hai: Haaye zamane ki barbadi! Pas tum mein se koi na kahe: Haaye zamane ki barbadi! Kyunke main hi zamana hun; main us ki raat aur din ko pherta hun; phir jab chahun unhein rok lun. wo kehta hai: Haaye zamane ki barbadi! Pas tum mein se koi na kahe: Haaye zamane ki barbadi! Kyunke main hi zamana hun; main us ki raat aur din ko pherta hun; phir jab chahun unhein rok lun."
"4345","[AI-translation] Allah taala ne farmaya: Ae mere bando, maine zulm ko apne upar haram kiya hai aur use tumhare darmiyan haram banaya hai; pas aapas mein zulm na karo. Ae mere bando, tum sab gumrah ho siwaye jis ko main hidayat dun; pas mujh se hidayat mango main tumhein hidayat dunga. Ae mere bando, tum sab bhooke ho siwaye jis ko main khilaun; pas mujh se khana mango main tumhein khilaunga. Ae mere bando, tum sab nange ho siwaye jis ko main pehnaun; pas mujh se libas mango main tumhein pehnaunga. Ae mere bando, tum raat aur din khata karte ho aur main tamam gunah bakhshta hun; pas mujh se bakhshish mango main tumhein bakhsh dunga. Ae mere bando, tum mere nuqsan tak nahi pahunch sakte ke mujhe nuqsan do aur mere faide tak nahi pahunch sakte ke mujhe faida do. Ae mere bando, agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, insaan aur jinn tum mein se aik shakhs ke sab se muttaqi dil par hon to ye mere mulk mein kuch izafa nahi karega. Ae mere bando, agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, insaan aur jinn tum mein se aik shakhs ke sab se badkaar dil par hon to ye mere mulk mein kuch kami nahi karega. Ae mere bando, agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, insaan aur jinn aik khule maidan mein khare hon aur mujh se mangein aur main har insaan ko us ka manga dun to mere paas jo hai us mein kami nahi hogi magar aise jaise sui samundar mein dakhil karne se kami hoti hai. Ae mere bando, ye tumhare aamaal hain jinhein main tumhare liye ginta hun phir tumhein un ka poora badla dunga; pas jo bhalayi paye wo Allah ki hamd kare aur jo us ke siwa paye wo apne aap ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"4346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ne kaha: Aaj raat main zaroor sadqa dunga; phir wo apne sadqe ke saath nikla aur use chor ke haath mein rakh diya. Subah log baatein karne lage: Aaj raat chor par sadqa kiya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, tere liye hamd hai chor par! Aaj raat main zaroor sadqa dunga; phir wo apne sadqe ke saath nikla aur use zaniya ke haath mein rakh diya. Subah log baatein karne lage: Aaj raat zaniya par sadqa kiya gaya! To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, tere liye hamd hai zaniya par! Aaj raat main zaroor sadqa dunga; phir wo apne sadqe ke saath nikla aur use ameer ke haath mein rakh diya. Subah log baatein karne lage: Aaj raat ameer par sadqa kiya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, tere liye hamd hai chor par, zaniya par aur ameer par. Phir us ke paas aaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Raha tumhara chor par sadqa to shayad wo apni chori se bache; aur rahi zaniya to shayad wo apne zina se bache; aur raha ameer to shayad wo ibrat le aur us mein se kharch kare jo Allah ne use diya."
"4347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ne kaha: Allah falan ko nahi bakhshega! To Allah taala ne nabiyon mein se aik Nabi ki taraf wahi ki: Ye gunah hai; pas wo amal ki taraf laut aaye."
"4348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sulaiman bin Dawood ne kaha: Aaj raat main zaroor sau auraton par phirunga, un mein se har aik aisa shah-sawar layegi jo Allah ki raah mein jihad karega. To un ke saathi ne un se kaha: Kaho: Insha Allah. To unhon ne Insha Allah na kaha. Phir wo un par phire to un mein se siwaye aik aurat ke koi haamila na hui jo aadhe insaan ko layi. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, agar wo kehte: Insha Allah to qasam na toot-ti aur wo un ki hajat ka zariya hota."
"4349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Ham us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein kutta ya tasweerain hon."
"4350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Khadija ko jannat mein moti ke ghar ki khushkhabri do jis mein na shor hoga na takleef."
"4351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Hafsa ki taraf ruju karo, kyunke wo roze rakhne wali qayam karne wali hain aur wo jannat mein tumhari biwi hain."
"4352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Kaho ke main Subah ke Rab ki panah mangta hun; to maine kaha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Kaho ke main logon ke Rab ki panah mangta hun; to maine kaha."
"4353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Kaash tum mujhe dekhte jab main samundar ki mitti leta aur Firaun ke munh mein thonsta is darr se ke use rehmat pa le."
"4354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Tumhari ummat mein se jo is haal mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. Maine kaha: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Unhon ne kaha: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho."
"4355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se Jibreel ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, jitna chahe jiyo beshak tum marne wale ho, jis se chahe mohabbat karo beshak tum us se juda hone wale ho, jo chahe amal karo beshak tum us se miloge."
"4356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farishton ne kaha: Ae Rab, wo tera banda burayi karne ka irada rakhta hai aur tu use zyada dekhne wala hai. To us ne farmaya: Use dekhte raho; phir agar wo use kare to us ke liye us jaisi likho, aur agar wo use chhore to us ke liye neki likho; us ne use meri wajah se chhora."
"4357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa Bani Israel mein khutba dene ke liye khare hue to un se pucha gaya ke logon mein sab se zyada jaanne wala kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main. To Allah ne un par itab kiya jab unhon ne ilm us ki taraf na lautaya. Aur Allah ne un ki taraf wahi ki: Mere liye do samundaron ke milne ki jagah par aik banda hai jo tum se zyada jaanne wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, mujhe wo kaise milega? Kaha gaya: Tokre mein machhli rakho; phir jab use kho do to wo wahin hai. Pas wo nikle aur un ke saath un ka khadim Yusha bin Noon nikla; aur unhon ne tokre mein machhli rakhi yahan tak ke jab wo chattan ke paas thay to unhon ne apne sar rakhe aur so gaye. To machhli tokre se nikal gayi aur samundar mein apna raasta surang ki tarah bana liya; aur Musa aur un ke khadim ke liye taajjub tha. Phir wo apne baaqi din aur raat chalte rahe. Phir jab subah hui to Musa ne apne khadim se kaha: Hamara nashta lao; yaqinan ham ne apne is safar mein thakan payi. Aur Musa ko thakan ka ehsas na hua tha yahan tak ke us jagah se aage barh gaye jis ka Allah ne unhein hukm diya tha. To un ke khadim ne un se kaha: Kiya tum ne dekha jab ham chattan ki taraf jhuke to main machhli bhool gaya. Musa ne kaha: Yehi wo hai jo ham chahte thay; pas wo apne nishanaat par wapas laute. Phir jab wo chattan tak pahunche to aik shakhs kapre mein lipta hua tha; Musa ne salam kiya to Khizr ne kaha: Tumhari zameen mein salam kahan? Unhon ne kaha: Main Musa hun. Unhon ne kaha: Bani Israel ke Musa? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Kiya main tumhari pairwi karun is par ke tum mujhe us mein se sikhayo jo tumhein hidayat mein sikhaya gaya? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum mere saath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge. Ae Musa, main Allah taala ke ilm mein se aik ilm par hun jo us ne mujhe sikhaya hai jo tum nahi jante, aur tum Allah taala ke ilm mein se aik ilm par ho jo Allah ne tumhein sikhaya hai jo main nahi janta. Unhon ne kaha: Tum mujhe Insha Allah sabir paoge aur main tumhare kisi hukm ki nafarmani nahi karunga. Phir wo donon sahil par chalte hue nikle; phir aik kashti guzri to unhon ne un se baat ki ke unhein sawaar kar lein; phir unhon ne Khizr ko pehchan liya to unhein baghair kiraye ke sawaar kar liya. Aur aik chirya aayi aur kashti ke kinare par baithi aur samundar mein aik ya do chonch mari. To Khizr ne kaha: Ae Musa, mere aur tumhare ilm ne Allah ke ilm mein kami nahi ki magar aise jaise is chirya ki chonch ne is samundar mein. Phir Khizr kashti ke takhton mein se aik takhte ki taraf barhe aur use ukhaar diya. To Musa ne kaha: Aik qaum ne hamein baghair kiraye ke sawaar kiya aur tum un ki kashti ki taraf barhe aur use phaar diya taake us walon ko dubo do? Unhon ne kaha: Kiya maine nahi kaha ke beshak tum mere saath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us par na pakro jo main bhoola. Pas ye Musa ki taraf se pehli bhool thi. Phir wo donon nikle; phir aik ladka ladkon ke saath khel raha tha to Khizr ne us ke sar ko upar se pakra aur apne haath se us ka sar ukhaar diya. To Musa ne un se kaha: Tum ne aik paak jaan ko baghair jaan ke badle qatl kar diya? Unhon ne kaha: Kiya maine tum se nahi kaha ke beshak tum mere saath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge. Phir wo donon nikle yahan tak ke jab aik basti walon ke paas aaye to unhon ne us ke rehne walon se khana manga to unhon ne un ki mezbani se inkar kar diya. Phir unhon ne us mein aik deewar payi jo girne wali thi; Khizr ne apne haath se use seedha kar diya. To Musa ne kaha: Agar tum chahte to us par ujrat lete. Unhon ne kaha: Ye mere aur tumhare darmiyan judayi hai. Allah Musa par rehem kare; kaash wo sabr karte yahan tak ke wo hamein un ke muamle mein se sunate."
"4358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ka apne bhai se ladna kufr hai aur use gaali dena fisq hai."
"4359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman se ladna kufr hai aur use gaali dena fisq hai; aur kisi Musalman ke liye halal nahi ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada qata-talluq kare."
"4360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaid mein qatl hona kisi gunah par nahi guzarta magar use mita deta hai."
"4361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka qatl Allah ke nazdeek duniya ke zawal se bara hai."
"4362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Unhon ne use qatl kar diya; Allah unhein qatl kare. Jab wo nahi jante thay to unhon ne sawal kyun na kiya? Aajizi ki shifa to sawal hai. Us ke liye bas ye kafi tha ke tayammum karta.... ..."
"4363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Unhon ne use qatl kar diya; Allah unhein qatl kare. Kiya aajizi ki shifa sawal na tha?"
"4364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhein ajr diya aur tumhein meeras mein lauta diya."
"4365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare is din mein do eidein jama ho gayin; pas jo chahe us ke liye juma se kafi ho, aur ham jama karne wale hain Insha Allah taala."
"4366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham ne panaah di jis ko tune panaah di ae Umm Hani."
"4367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhein ijazat di hai ke apni hajat ke liye bahar niklo."
"4368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kamyaab hua jo Islam laya, guzare ke mutabiq rizq diya gaya aur Allah ne use us par qanaat di jo us ne use ata kiya."
"4369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein roshan raah par chhora hai jis ki raat us ke din jaisi hai; mere baad us se sirf halak hone wala hate ga. Aur tum mein se jo jiye ga wo bahut ikhtilaf dekhega; pas tum par lazim hai jo tum ne meri sunnat mein se jana aur khulafa-e-rashideen mehdi ki sunnat se; use daanton se mazboot pakro. Aur tum par itaat lazim hai agarche Habshi ghulam ho; kyunke momin naakel wale oont ki tarah hai jahan use morha jaye mur jata hai."
"4370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum halal ho gayin jab tum ne apna hamal waza kiya."
"4371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mujh se qareeb ho gayi yahan tak ke agar main us ki taraf himmat karta to tumhare paas us ke khoshon mein se kuch lata; aur aag mujh se qareeb ho gayi yahan tak ke maine kaha: Ae Rab, aur main un ke saath hun? Phir aik aurat thi jise billi noch rahi thi; maine kaha: Is ka kiya muamla hai? Unhon ne kaha: Us ne use qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo bhook se mar gayi; na us ne use khilaya na use chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore kha le."
"4372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine abhi dekha jab se tumhein namaz parhayi jannat aur aag mere liye is deewar ke saamne numainda ki gayin; maine aaj jaise bhalayi aur burayi mein kuch nahi dekha."
"4373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne us par us ke donon beton par rehem ki wajah se rehem kiya."
"4374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne Allah se muqarrar muddaton, gine hue dinon aur taqseem shuda rizq ka sawal kiya hai; wo un mein se kisi ko us ke waqt se pehle jaldi nahi karta na us mein se kisi ko us ke waqt ke baad dair karta hai. Aur agar tum Allah se sawal karti ke tumhein aag ke azaab aur qabar ke azaab se panaah de to tumhare liye behtar aur afzal hota."
"4375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne aaj raat tum donon ke apne mehman ke saath kiye par taajjub kiya."
"4376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham namaz se farigh ho chuke; pas jo khutbe ke liye baithna chahe baithe aur jo jana chahe jaye."
"4377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle guzri ummaton mein aise log thay jin se baatein ki jati thin; phir agar meri ummat mein un mein se koi hai to wo Umar bin Khattab hain."
"4378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main na-pasand karta tha ke tum kehte: Jo Allah chahe aur Muhammad chahe, lekin kaho: Jo Allah chahe phir Muhammad chahe."
"4379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha; pas Muhammad ko un ki walida ki qabar ki ziyarat ki ijazat di gayi hai; pas un ki ziyarat karo, kyunke wo tumhein aakhirat yaad dilati hai."
"4380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne taqdeerein aasmanon aur zameenon ko paida karne se pachaas hazaar saal pehle muqaddar kein."
"4381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Madina aaya aur ahle Madina ke liye jahiliyyat mein do din thay jin mein wo khelte thay; aur beshak Allah taala ne tumhein un ke badle un se behtar diya hai: Fitr ka din aur Qurbani ka din."
"4382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish ko aage karo aur un se aage na barho, Quraish se seekho aur unhein na sikhayo; aur agar Quraish itra na jaye to main unhein batata ke Allah ke paas un ke behtareen logon ke liye kiya hai."
"4383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish ko aage karo aur un se aage na barho, un se seekho aur unhein na sikhayo."
"4384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish ko aage karo aur un se aage na barho; aur agar Quraish itra na jaye to main unhein batata ke Allah ke paas un ke liye kiya hai."
"4385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use apne haath se cheer do."
"4386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use qareeb karo; wo apni jagah pahunch chuki hai."
"4387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use qareeb karo; wo ghar kitna faqeer hai jis mein salan mein sirka na ho."
"4388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se aik Nabi ko cheenti ne kaata to unhon ne cheentiyon ki basti ko jalane ka hukm diya to use jala diya gaya. To Allah taala ne un ki taraf wahi ki: Tumhein aik cheenti ne kaata aur tum ne tasbeeh karne wali ummaton mein se aik ummat ko jala diya?"
"4389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish, Ansar, Juhaina, Muzaina, Aslam, Ashja aur Ghifar maula hain; Allah aur us ke Rasool ke siwa un ka koi maula nahi."
"4390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish qayamat ke din tak bhalayi aur burayi mein logon ke hakim hain."
"4391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish is muamle ke hakim hain; pas logon ke naik un ke naik ke tabay hain aur un ke badkaar un ke badkaar ke tabay hain."
"4392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Moonchhein kato aur darhiyan barhao."
"4393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wapsi jihad ki tarah hai."
"4394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne in mashair par thehro; kyunke tum apne baap Ibrahim ke wirse mein se wirse par ho."
"4395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho ke main Allah par iman laya phir sabit qadam raho."
"4396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho ke main Subah ke Rab ki panah mangta hun aur kaho ke main logon ke Rab ki panah mangta hun; logon ne un donon se behtar kisi cheez se panah nahi mangi."
"4397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Tum par salamti ho; kiya main dakhil hun?"
"4398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem kar, mujhe aafiyat de aur mujhe rizq de; kyunke ye tumhare liye tumhari duniya aur aakhirat jama karte hain."
"4399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun apne kaan ke shar se, apni aankh ke shar se, apni zaban ke shar se, apne dil ke shar se aur apni mani ke shar se."
"4400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, maine apne aap par bahut zulm kiya hai aur gunaahon ko tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta; pas mujhe apne paas se bakhshish de aur mujh par rehem kar; beshak tu hi bakhshne wala rehem wala hai."
"4401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe hidayat de aur durust rakh; aur hidayat se raaste ki apni rehnumayi aur durusti se teer ke seedha hone ko yaad karo."
"4402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale, ghaib aur hazir ke jaanne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur maalik; main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabood nahi; main teri panah mangta hun apne nafs ke shar se, shaitan ke shar aur us ke shirk se. Use kaho jab subah karo, jab shaam karo aur jab apna bichhona pakro."
"4403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho jaisa wo kehte hain; phir jab farigh ho jao to mango diya jaoge, yani muazzin."
"4404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho wo Allah hai jo aik hai, Quran ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai."
"4405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho wo Allah hai jo aik hai, Quran ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai; aur kaho ae kafiro, Quran ke chauthe hisse ke barabar hai."
"4406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho wo Allah hai jo aik hai aur muawwizatain, jab shaam karo aur jab subah karo teen baar, tumhein har cheez se kafi hongi."
"4407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Burhe ka dil do cheezon ki mohabbat par jawan hai: zindagi ki mohabbat aur maal ki."
"4408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Burhe ka dil do cheezon ki mohabbat par jawan hai: lambi zindagi aur kasrat-e-maal."
"4409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shukr-guzar dil, zikr karne wali zaban aur naik biwi jo tumhari duniya aur deen ke muamle mein tumhari madad kare, logon ke jama kiye hue mein sab se behtar hai."
"4410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zyada miqdar nasha de us ki thori haram hai."
"4411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat ke darwaze par khara hua to jo us mein dakhil hue un ki aksariyat miskeen thay; aur maal wale roke hue thay siwaye aag walon ke to unhein aag ki taraf le jane ka hukm diya gaya. Aur main aag ke darwaze par khara hua to jo us mein dakhil honge un ki aksariyat auratein thin."
"4412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere mimbar ke paaye jannat mein lage hue hain."
"4413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka guzara us ke bure logon par hai."
"4414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad Ummi Nabi par aur Aal-e-Muhammad par durood bhej jaisa tune Aal-e-Ibrahim par durood bheja, aur Muhammad Ummi Nabi par barkat bhej jaisa tune Aal-e-Ibrahim par jahano mein barkat bheji; beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai. Aur salam waisa hai jaisa tum jaan chuke ho."
"4415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad par jo tera banda aur Rasool hai durood bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim par durood bheja, aur Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat bheji."
"4416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad par aur Aal-e-Muhammad par durood bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim par aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par durood bheja; beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai. Ae Allah, Muhammad par aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat bheji; beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai."
"4417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad par, un ki biwiyon aur aulad par durood bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim par durood bheja, aur Muhammad par, un ki biwiyon aur aulad par barkat bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim par barkat bheji; beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai."
"4418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni kuch baat kaho aur shaitan tum par ghalib na aaye."
"4419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhalayi kaho faida uthao ge, aur burayi se khamosh raho salamat raho ge."
"4420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Jo Allah chahe phir tum chaho."
"4421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Mominon aur Musalmanon mein se bastiyon walon par salamti ho; aur Allah ham mein se aage barhne walon aur peeche rehne walon par rehem kare; aur ham Insha Allah tum se milne wale hain."
"4422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe aur use bakhsh de aur mujhe us ki taraf se achcha badla de."
"4423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, tu maaf karne wala hai, maafi ko pasand karta hai, pas mujhe maaf kar de."
"4424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, saaton aasmanon ke Rab aur Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab, hamare Rab aur har cheez ke Rab, Taurat, Injeel aur Quran utarne wale, daane aur guthli ko cheerne wale; main teri panah mangta hun har cheez ke shar se jis ki peshani tu pakre hue hai. Tu Awwal hai pas tujh se pehle kuch nahi, Tu Aakhir hai pas tere baad kuch nahi, Tu Zahir hai pas tujh se upar kuch nahi aur Tu Batin hai pas tujh se neeche kuch nahi. Mujh se qarz ada kar de aur mujhe faqr se ghani kar de."
"4425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Labbaik Ae Allah Labbaik; aur zameen mein se mera tehrao wahan hai jahan tu mujhe roke; kyunke tere liye tere Rab par wo hai jo tune shart kiya."
"4426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Utho aisi jannat ki taraf jis ki chaurayi aasman aur zameen hai."
"4427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne sardar ki taraf utho."
"4428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Utho, kyunke maut mein ghabrahat hai."
"4429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein ladne ke liye saff mein aik ghari qayam saath saal ke qayam se behtar hai."
"4430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel se kaha gaya: Darwaze mein sajda karte hue dakhil ho aur kaho bakhsh de; to unhon ne badal diya aur apne sireenon par ghisat-te hue dakhil hue aur kaha: Jau mein daana."
"4431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dopahar ko aaraam karo, kyunke shaitan aaraam nahi karte."
"4432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bandho aur tawakkul karo."
"4433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use bandho aur tawakkul karo."
"4434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilm ko likhne se bandho."
"4435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad qayam karne wala jannat mein hai, jo us ke baad qayam kare wo jannat mein hai aur teesra aur chautha jannat mein hain."
"4436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qatil wirasat nahi payega."
"4437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz par baithne wala khare hone wale ki tarah hai; aur namaziyon mein likha jata hai jab se apne ghar se nikle yahan tak ke apne ghar wapas laut aaye."
"4438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein qatl shahadat hai, taaoon shahadat hai, pait shahadat hai, doobna shahadat hai aur bachcha janne wali shahadat hai."
"4439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein qatl shahadat hai, taaoon shahadat hai, doobna shahadat hai, pait shahadat hai, jalna shahadat hai; aur tap-daq aur bachcha janne wali ko us ka bachcha apni naal se kheench kar jannat ki taraf le jayega."
"4440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein qatl har khata ko mita deta hai siwaye qarz ke."
"4441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein maqtool shaheed hai, pait wala shaheed hai, taaoon-zada shaheed hai, doobne wala shaheed hai aur bachcha janne wali shaheeda hai."
"4442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qadriya is ummat ke majoosi hain; agar beemar hon to un ki ayadat na karo aur agar mar jayen to un ke janaze mein hazir na ho."
"4443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran sifarish karne wala hai jis ki sifarish qabool ki jayegi aur jhagadne wala hai jis ki tasdeeq ki jayegi; jo use apne aage rakhe wo use jannat ki taraf le jayega aur jo use apne peeche rakhe wo use aag ki taraf hankega."
"4444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran saat harfon par parha jata hai; pas Quran mein jhagda na karo, kyunke Quran mein jhagda kufr hai."
"4445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qisas teen hain: ameer, mamoor ya fakhr karne wala."
"4446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qazi teen hain: do aag mein aur aik jannat mein. Wo shakhs jis ne haq jana aur us ke saath faisla kiya wo jannat mein hai; wo shakhs jis ne logon ke liye jahalat par faisla kiya wo aag mein hai; aur wo shakhs jis ne haq jana phir faisle mein zulm kiya wo aag mein hai."
"4447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qazi teen hain: do qazi aag mein aur aik qazi jannat mein. Wo qazi jis ne khwahish se faisla kiya wo aag mein hai, wo qazi jis ne baghair ilm ke faisla kiya wo aag mein hai aur wo qazi jis ne haq se faisla kiya wo jannat mein hai."
